## Install

One `### <id>` block per need, one line per environment key, best first. Keys: an operating system (`windows`, `macos`, `linux`, `wsl`), a harness (`claude-code`, `cowork`, `codex`, `copilot`, `cursor`, `gemini-cli`), a package manager on PATH (`winget`, `brew`, `apt`, `pip`, `uv`, `npm`, `ollama`), a combination (`linux/apt`, `windows/claude-code`), or `any`. A line is backticked commands joined by `then` (scriptable) or prose steps. Tags in a trailing parenthesis: `admin` (elevation or sudo), `manual` (a person must act: an account, a licence, a GUI), `large` (a big download), `secret` (a key or token the user holds), `paid`, and `verified YYYY-MM-DD on <os>/<harness>`. Shared recipes for common tools are in the plugin's `setup/RECIPES.md`; only list one here when this skill needs something different.

### <id>

