An access recipe is a line with indented numbered steps the agent walks the user through, one at a time: sign in, ask for the narrowest read role at the narrowest scope (`evergreen.py setup <unit> --request <id>` drafts the request), wait, re-check. Names of people, internal links, server and tenant ids go here only when this unit is private; otherwise in the store book.

